        1538,
        1133
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, Subchapter C of Title XIII of the Omnibus Budget Reconciliation Act of 1993, Public Law 103-66 (the \"Act\") authorizes the establishment of an Empowerment Zone Program under which a community of not more than 200,000 people in New York City may be designated to receive special investment and training credits and major funding for social services which would enhance the economic self-sufficiency of zone residents; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2547,
          "min": -1.3649
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 100,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0111
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 44649,
        "area_px": 242916,
        "density": 0.1838,
        "chars": 428,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.59
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        232,
        1178,
        1536,
        1289
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Act allows an area to be nominated for Empowerment Zone status by the local government and State in which it is located or by an economic development corporation chartered by the State; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2184,
          "min": -1.1927
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 41,
          "mean": -0.0025,
          "min": -0.1003
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 20096,
        "area_px": 146048,
        "density": 0.1376,
        "chars": 202,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.05
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        232,
        1331,
        1536,
        1442
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the community of Harlem, defined as the areas of Community Boards 9, 10, and 11, meets the eligibility criteria for designation as an Empowerment Zone under the Act; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1939,
          "min": -1.1235
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 44,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0003
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 18488,
        "area_px": 144744,
        "density": 0.12773,
        "chars": 178,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.63
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        234,
        1486,
        1536,
        1598
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, Rep. Charles B. Rangel of the Fifteenth Congressional District has invited the City of New York to work with him in securing Empowerment Zone status for the Harlem Community; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2014,
          "min": -1.2627
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
